---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../../config/site';
---
<Layout
  title="Search Indexing Diagnostics | ZixTool"
  description="Check search discovery using the published sitemap and Google Search Console. IndexNow notifications do not confirm indexing."
  canonical={`${siteConfig.url}/internal/indexing-tester/`}
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 space-y-4">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">Search indexing diagnostics</h1>
    <p>Tool pages are not eligible for Google's Indexing API. That API supports job postings and livestream pages; a successful notification is not proof that a URL is indexed.</p>
    <p>Submit the sitemap in Google Search Console, then use URL Inspection to check a specific URL's indexing status, selected canonical, and crawl results.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/sitemap-index.xml">View the published XML sitemap</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://search.google.com/search-console">Open Google Search Console</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://developers.google.com/search/apis/indexing-api/v3/quickstart">Read Google's Indexing API eligibility rules</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>IndexNow notifications run after deployment through the existing deployment workflow. Check the workflow logs for delivery results. HTTP 200 confirms submission; HTTP 202 means key validation is pending. Neither response guarantees indexing or ranking.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
